# Step 006 — ADD_COMPONENT UICOMP_XDUO_0006 CategoryEditorWindow

```step
anchor: ADD_COMPONENT
id: UICOMP_XDUO_0006
name: CategoryEditorWindow
kind: component
language: fsharp
declaring_project: OpticalConstructor.TestWindows
touches: [OpticalConstructor.TestWindows, OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests]
depends_on: [3, 4, 5]
```

**How to implement.** Create the Category editor window in OpticalConstructor.TestWindows beside the existing MaterialEditorWindow / SampleEditorWindow, over the step-4 CategoryEditor edit model and the step-5 CategoryControls. Add opens an inline UserCategory / SelectableOnCreate row; Rename edits name inline (built-ins renamable); Remove is confirm-gated inline and surfaces CategoryStillReferenced (naming the referencing materials) or BuiltInNotRemovable; Save calls the matching CategoryProxy verb (addCategory / updateCategory / removeCategory), Cancel discards; Save/Cancel sit in one row with distinct positive/negative styling. Stable UiIds reuse the step-5 constants plus CategoryEditorWindow. Headless tests in OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests drive the window by UiIds over a stub CategoryProxy: add-then-list grows the list, rename updates the name, and removing a referenced category surfaces the block and leaves the list unchanged.

**Acceptance.** After the step, headless tests MUST drive CategoryEditorWindow by UiIds over a stub CategoryProxy: Add grows the list, Rename updates a name, and removing a referenced or built-in category surfaces the typed block and leaves the list unchanged.
